        <item>
            <title>2.14.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 22:34:41 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>87</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

- Automated sessions no longer leak into the sidebar as "Untitled". Sessions started by the Agent SDK — background reviews and similar tooling — are meant to be hidden, but any session whose opening record was larger than the metadata window slipped past the filter and showed up as an untitled row.
- Sessions with a very large first message now show their real title instead of "Untitled".
- Resuming a session that had been moved into a git worktree could open the wrong directory, leaving an empty session behind. The relocation marker is now found reliably regardless of where it sits in the transcript.
]]></description>
